<p>Once verification is complete, the team proceeds to functional testing of all electrical and mechanical equipment. This ensures that items are operational before they are placed in the workspace.</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Electrical Testing:</strong> Use calibrated multimeters and insulation testers to verify voltage, continuity, and grounding compliance with safety standards.</li>
<li><strong>Mechanical Testing:</strong> Operate moving parts, check for abnormal noises, and confirm torque specifications using appropriate gauges.</li>
<li><strong>Result Logging:</strong> Document test outcomes, flag any failures, and arrange immediate service or replacement if needed.</li>
</ul>

<p>After successful testing, clean furniture placement begins. The area is first cleared of dust and debris, then each piece is positioned according to the floor plan, ensuring ergonomic alignment and stability.</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Wipe down tabletops, legs, and contact points with a lint‑free cloth and mild cleaner.</li>
<li><strong>Placement Accuracy:</strong> Align chairs, desks, and storage units to designated coordinates, checking levelness with a spirit level.</li>
<li><strong>Final Inspection:</strong> Verify that all items are free of scratches, securely assembled, and ready for use.</li>
</ul>

<p>The protocol concludes with swift removal of all packing debris. This step restores a safe, clutter‑free environment and complies with waste‑management guidelines.</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Debris Collection:</strong> Gather boxes, bubble wrap, foam inserts, and tape.</li>
<li><strong>Segregation:</strong> Separate recyclable materials from non‑recyclable waste.</li>
<li><strong>Disposal:</strong> Transfer recyclables to the designated bin and arrange for proper disposal of residual waste, documenting the process for audit purposes.</li>
</ul>

<p>By adhering to this structured sequence—daylight verification, thorough testing, meticulous placement, and prompt debris removal—the Pune delivery team ensures that every item arrives in perfect condition, functions as intended, and integrates seamlessly into the client’s operational space.</p></div>
